# Server (`:server`)

- JVM Ktor 3.x only; trust `X-Forwarded-*` headers behind Caddy **only** when the peer is `127.0.0.1`.
- Verify Google OIDC ID tokens on `/api/v1/auth/google` and issue own HS256 JWT + rotating refresh sessions (**no Firebase**, no password storage); **401/403** for missing/insufficient auth.
- Public routes: only what RGPD allows (consent, no minors public, no internal notes/amounts).
- SQLite: open via `openDatabase()` (WAL + foreign keys + `busy_timeout=5000`, single-writer pool + reader connections); one-sided relations persisted per model v0.2.
- Schema changes: replace the pre-production v0.1 `V1__initial_schema.sqm` with v0.2 (`V1` + `V2__seed.sqm`) per `docs/decisiones.md`; once deployed to production, never edit applied migrations — add a new `V<n>__<name>.sqm` instead.
- Validate input at boundaries using `:core` validators; consistent JSON error bodies (§6.3) and HTTP status codes.
- No blocking work on the Netty event loop — use appropriate dispatchers (`Dispatchers.IO` for SQLite/files/image resize).
- Koin modules for routes/services/repositories; share DTOs from `:core`.
- Tests in `:server:test` for auth matrix, public filtering, OpenAPI route sync, and critical SQL paths.
